  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Copper Seal mountain stands red and squarish in Mini Southern Border, with no soil at all, formed entirely from copper. Pragna copper is named among its mortal level copper, with chaotic sky copper and snow flower copper listed beside it, while immortal copper such as profound gray copper and ascending dragon copper occupy only a small portion. Mortal level copper is the greatest amount and occupies the most space. The mountain’s unique rank seven copper is domination copper.",
      "chapters": [
        1615
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "copper-seal-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After a myriad tribulation, Copper Seal Mountain is half destroyed and molten. The text again names pragna copper among the mortal level copper that once made up the mountain, with chaotic sky copper and snow flower copper beside it. Domination copper production on that mountain is lost after the strike.",
